  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 188, 'Send your teen a friendly text during the day that asks nothing of them.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 189, 'Tell a co-parent or friend which part of the day is hardest for you, and brainstorm one small fix together.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 190, 'Write down one thing you''re proud of as a parent today, however small.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 191, 'Notice what time of day you have the least patience, and plan one easy thing for that time tomorrow.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 192, 'Close your eyes for three slow breaths in the parked car before taking the kids into a store.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 193, 'Lower your tone when your child is whining, and match it with slower words.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 194, 'Kneel down when your child is shy at a new place, and stay at their level until they feel ready.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 195, 'Name a sibling''s feeling to the other child today, as in, "Your brother is upset because his game got knocked over."'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 196, 'Plan ahead for homework by agreeing on a start time and a short break with your child.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 197, 'Put bedtime pajamas and toothbrushes out early in the evening so bedtime has fewer steps.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 198, 'Keep a simple snack in the car for after-school hunger, so the ride home starts on a better note.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 199, 'Say sorry to your child for rushing them today, and explain that you were late, not that they were.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 200, 'Get a little movement in today, a short walk or a few stretches, before the kids come home.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 201, 'Allow cereal for dinner one night this week if it means a calmer evening.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 202, 'Let your child stay up ten minutes later for some quiet one-on-one time on the couch.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 203, 'Make a game of following your child''s lead in pretend play for five minutes.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 204, 'Invent a funny name for a household chore and use it when you ask for help today.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 205, 'Go for a drive or walk with your teen without any agenda, and let silence be fine.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 206, 'Hand the baby or toddler to another adult for ten minutes when you feel close to snapping.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 207, 'Tell your child at bedtime one thing you enjoyed doing with them today.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 208, 'Notice if your shoulders rise toward your ears when the kids are loud, and let them drop.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 209, 'Tell yourself, "This is a hard moment, not a bad kid," when you feel your temper rise.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 210, 'Stand still and silent for a moment the next time your child does something annoying on purpose, before you say anything.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 211, 'Speak in a slower, softer voice when you wake your child up this morning.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 212, 'Sit on the floor next to your child when they''re building or drawing, and just watch for a while.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 213, 'Describe your child''s feeling during a sibling fight without taking sides, then help them find words of their own.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 214, 'Give your child a choice of two jobs during cleanup time, so they feel some control.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 215, 'On a long road trip, plan stops every couple of hours where everyone can stretch and run around.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 216, 'During a holiday meal, take your child aside for a short break if they get restless, and walk together outside.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 217, 'Prepare a simple answer for the questions you dread at bedtime, like "Can I have one more show?"'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 218, 'When a sibling fight ends, reconnect with each child separately for a minute.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 219, 'Take a pause before scolding your teen about their room, and ask yourself whether it matters today.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 220, 'Rub your palms together and feel their warmth when you notice a flash of frustration with your kids.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 221, 'Plan your kids'' after-school snack in the morning so the hungry hour has an easy answer.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 222, 'Ask your child to help you plan tomorrow''s breakfast, and let them pick one thing.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 223, 'Choose one bedtime song or story that signals winding down, and use it every night this week.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 224, 'Give your child a hug before giving them a correction, and see how it changes the conversation.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 225, 'Keep a small notebook in the kitchen for jotting down sweet things your kids say.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 226, 'Take a deep breath before you open the bedroom door to a messy room.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 227, 'Practice saying a calm phrase in the mirror, like "We''ll figure this out," so it''s ready when you need it.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 228, 'Sit at the kitchen table with your teen while they eat a snack, and let the talk be about anything.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 229, 'Offer your child a "do-over" when they speak rudely, giving them a chance to try the words again.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 230, 'Notice when you feel rushed today, and slow your steps for a few paces as a reminder.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 231, 'Choose one evening this week as a no-plans night at home.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 232, 'At the end of a hard day, tell your child, "Tomorrow is a fresh start for both of us."'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 233, 'Ask your child what makes mornings hard for them, and try one of their ideas.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 234, 'Hold eye contact and nod while your child tells a long story, without hurrying them along.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 235, 'Agree on a simple signal with your partner, like a tap on the arm, that means "I need you to take over."'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 236, 'Keep your voice low and steady when telling your child it''s time to leave a friend''s house.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 237, 'Turn bath time into a playful moment with bubbles, cups or a toy boat.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 238, 'Listen to your teen talk about a friendship problem, and resist the urge to say what they should do.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 239, 'Make a mental note of one thing that went smoothly at breakfast and tell your family about it at dinner.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 240, 'Unplug from your phone for the first fifteen minutes after you get home with the kids.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 241, 'Notice the tone of your voice in the car today, and soften it if it''s sharp.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 242, 'Before you tell your child to hurry, check the clock and see if there''s actually more time than it feels.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 243, 'Hum or sing softly to yourself when you feel tension creeping in during the morning rush.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 244, 'Take a short pause after your child asks for something, before answering, to give yourself a moment.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 245, 'Talk with your child about a tricky moment from earlier, once both of you are calm.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 246, 'Say, "I love you even when we disagree," to your child after a disagreement today.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 247, 'Invite your child to join you for a quiet activity, like folding laundry or watering plants, and chat as you go.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 248, 'Plan a fun Saturday morning with your kids that requires no screens and little planning.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 249, 'Have a backup plan for a meltdown at the store, like stepping outside together for a few minutes.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 250, 'Lie down next to your young child at bedtime for five extra minutes tonight and listen to their breathing.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 251, 'Ask your child how they would like to calm down when they''re upset, and write their ideas down.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 252, 'Bring along a favorite small toy or book when you know there will be waiting, like at an appointment.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 253, 'When your child refuses to eat, take a break from coaxing and enjoy your own meal.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 254, 'Take a short break from correcting your child for an entire meal, and see how it feels.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 255, 'Before homework starts, ask your child which part they think will be easiest, and begin there.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 256, 'Let your teen have the last word in a small disagreement today, and let it go.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 257, 'Write a short list of people you could call when parenting feels heavy, and keep it on the fridge.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 258, 'Notice when you''re starting to repeat yourself, and stop to check whether your child actually heard you.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 259, 'Lean against a wall and take a slow breath when your child is testing limits, before you respond.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 260, 'Put on a funny hat or accent when you ask the kids to set the table tonight.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 261, 'Leave five minutes earlier for school pickup today so you can arrive calm.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 262, 'Ask a neighbor or another parent to trade a school pickup with you this week.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 263, 'Tell your child about a time you got frustrated as a kid, and what helped you.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 264, 'Take the long way home from school on a nice day, and enjoy the extra time with your child.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 265, 'Swap a chore with your partner or roommate this week so you each get a break from the hardest one.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 266, 'Choose a time when everyone is calm to talk with your kids about how to handle sibling fights.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 267, 'Make a plan for what you''ll do the next time screen time ends with tears, like offering a hug and a snack.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 268, 'Give each child a turn to choose the car music on alternate days.'),
