  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 278, 'Watch a movie with your teen that they choose, and ask what they liked about it.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 279, 'Notice your child''s attempts to connect today, like a question or a story, and turn toward them.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 280, 'Find out from your partner or a friend what they noticed you did well as a parent this week.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 281, 'Go for a walk around the block alone after dinner while another adult watches the kids.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 282, 'On the first warm day of spring, take your kids to a park and let them run as long as they want.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 283, 'In autumn, gather leaves with your kids and let them jump in the pile, mess and all.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 284, 'During a long winter break, plan one outing a few days in so everyone gets fresh air.'),
