  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 287, 'At a family gathering, check in with your child every hour with a quick hug or wink.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 288, 'Make a "calm-down corner" with your child, with pillows and a couple of soft toys.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 289, 'Lower your expectations for the house during school breaks, and focus on enjoying the extra time.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 290, 'Offer your child a squeeze or a high five as a way to reconnect after a correction.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 291, 'Repeat your child''s words back to them, like "You wanted the green bowl," before explaining why they can''t have it.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 292, 'Notice the end of a hard moment, and take one deep breath to let it go before moving on.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 293, 'Picture your child as a much younger version of themselves the next time they frustrate you, and let that soften your response.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 294, 'Silently say "Slow" to yourself before you answer the next demand from your kids.'),
