  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 296, 'Count backward from ten in your head while your child finishes putting on their shoes.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 297, 'Use a calm "Hmm" or "Oh" to buy yourself a second before responding to a surprise mess.'),
