  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 351, 'Thank yourself at the end of the day for every small effort you made to stay calm.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 352, 'Pause before every "no" today, and ask whether it could be a "yes, after."'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 353, 'Speak quietly and calmly to your child the next time they wake up grumpy.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 354, 'Keep a spare change of clothes in the car for messy surprises on outings.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 355, 'When your child asks "Why?" for the fifth time, answer once more with curiosity, then ask what they think.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 356, 'Remember a happy memory with your child when you feel tense, and let it soften your tone.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 357, 'Spend a few minutes in your car, a quiet corner or the yard when you need to collect yourself.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 358, 'Leave a kind note for your child to find in their lunchbox or backpack.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 359, 'Ask your teen if they''d like a ride with a friend, and listen to their chatter without joining in.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 360, 'Take time this week to look back over this challenge and list the moments you''re proud of.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 361, 'Pick a family motto for hard moments, like "We stick together," and say it together this week.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 362, 'Ask a teacher or coach what your child enjoys most, and talk with your child about it tonight.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 363, 'Take a picture of a happy moment with your kids today, and look at it when you need a reminder.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 364, 'Make time for a family hug before everyone goes their separate ways in the morning.'),
  ('finding-patience-with-your-kids', 365, 'Notice how far you''ve come with patience at home, and share one example with someone you trust.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 1, 'Choose what to eat for breakfast within thirty seconds of opening the fridge, then enjoy it without second-guessing.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 2, 'Pick out tomorrow''s outfit tonight in under two minutes and leave it on a chair, finished.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 3, 'Write down one decision you have been circling, then set a deadline for it on your calendar.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 4, 'Decide which errand to run first today by picking the one closest to your front door.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 5, 'Give yourself a five-minute timer for a small choice today and commit when the bell rings.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 6, 'Settle on a "good enough" lunch order today instead of searching for the perfect one.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 7, 'Narrow one open choice down to just two options, crossing the rest off a list.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 8, 'Jot three quick pros and three quick cons for a pending choice, then stop writing.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 9, 'Ask yourself which option in front of you today fits what matters most to you, and choose that one.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 10, 'Imagine a close friend describing your dilemma, and write the advice you would give them.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 11, 'Notice one moment today when you reach for more information, and ask whether it will truly change your mind.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 12, 'Sort three decisions on your plate into "easy to undo" and "hard to undo."'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 13, 'Flip a coin for a small choice today and pay attention to the feeling you have as it lands.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 14, 'Sleep on one bigger choice tonight, and promise yourself you will decide tomorrow morning.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 15, 'Ask one trusted person for their view on a choice today, and leave it at that one voice.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 16, 'Once you make a choice today, say "Decided" out loud and turn to the next thing.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 17, 'Pause for ten seconds after making a choice today and notice whether your shoulders loosen.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 18, 'Pick a restaurant for your next meal out from no more than three options, and book it.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 19, 'Let go of the option you passed on today by writing it on a scrap of paper and tossing it.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 20, 'Make a small purchase decision today with a two-minute limit, and buy or walk away when time is up.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 21, 'Choose a weekend plan by Wednesday evening and tell whoever is involved.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 22, 'At work today, answer one question you would normally put off with a clear yes or no.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 23, 'Decide what to cook for dinner by noon, so the evening holds one less question.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 24, 'Before checking another review, close the tab and choose from what you already know.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 25, 'Write the single most important value guiding a current choice on a sticky note and place it where you will see it.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 26, 'Pick a movie or show tonight in under three minutes, then watch it all the way through.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 27, 'Set a spending limit before shopping today and let that number make choices for you.'),
  ('making-decisions-without-agonizing', 28, 'Decide which household chore comes first this evening by doing the shortest one.'),
